d-state.json` ->\nevery prebuild gap below is pending.\n\nStatus legend: `seen Dnn` = GM-confirmed lane-day (solver in `challenges/<cal-day>/web-*/solver/solve.py`, handler in\n`lib/web/handlers/`). `gap` = nothing reusable in lib. Prebuilt web modules must be PURE (no `urllib.request`): bodies\nin -> request plan `[(method, path, headers, body)]` out; response in -> proof or next hints. The solver fetches.\n\n## Coverage table\n\n| # | concept | status | recognition cues | first move | likelihood next 3 cal. days |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | exposed backup / forced browsing via robots | seen D01 (Mastery x3) | robots `Disallow: /<word>-<hex>/`, \"crawler policy\", \"archive\" | robots -> index -> every link (depth 2) | done; Mastery |\n| 2 | IDOR (object-level authz) | seen D02 (Mastery x2) | \"Signed in as\", `/<things>/<id>`, `fetch('/api/<things>/'+id)` | foreign ids from `/api/history` | done; Mastery |\n| 3 | SQL injection (tautology) | seen D03 | search form, \"database\", \"one pointed question\" | `zz') OR 1=1 --` family + quote-balanced | done; Mastery |\n| 3b | second-order SQLi (stored value queried later) | seen D12 | \"plant your question inside the data and come back later\", \"delayed echo\", feature 405 `post_required`, secondary `{\"rows\":[],\"effect\":..}` | POST JSON every field = `x' OR '1'='1' -- `, GET secondary; `rows[]` holds proof | done; Mastery |\n| 4 | path traversal / LFI | seen D04 (Mastery) | `?doc=`/`?page=` filename value, \"mounted at /path\" | `../`*10 + prompt path | done; Mastery |\n| 5 | missing function-level authz (unlinked route) | seen D05 (Mastery) | \"staff-only, just a sign\", clue `feature_route` | GET the clue route | done; Mastery |\n| 6 | role / privilege via client-controlled header, query or cookie | gap | `current_role: analyst` in every clue JSON, `role=` cookie, `X-Role` in errors | flip the value the app names | high (D13 did the body form) |\n| 7 | JWT tampering (`alg:none`, leaked HS256 secret, kid/jku) | gap | 3 base64url parts in cookie / `Authorization`, `jwks.json`, \"token\", \"claims\", \"signature\" | decode; resign with `none` / leaked secret | very high (D20 \"sign nothing\" sequel) |\n| 8 | signed-cookie / session forgery (Flask, Express `s:`, base64 JSON) | gap (unsigned form seen D20) | `session=eyJ...`, `s%3A`, base64 JSON cookie + `.sig` | decode; re-sign with a leaked secret | high |\n| 9 | mass assignment / over-posting | seen D13 | \"the form only asked for your name. But the API binds whatever you hand it\", \"promotion\", feature 405 `post_required`, secondary 403 `administrator_required` | POST JSON `display_name` + role/is_admin/isAdmin/admin/roles/access_level/permissions, GET secondary | done; Mastery |\n| 10 | OS command injection | seen D16 | \"a little too close to a real shell\", \"give it something to do\", clues `input_parameter` + `example_path`, 400 `path_required`, JSON `stdout` | `?<param>=<example>%3Bcat /run/huntress/objective.txt` (raw `;` dropped by Go) | done; Mastery |\n| 11 | SSTI (expression in a rendered message) | seen D11 | \"template engine ... evaluates everything\", \"speak in expressions\", \"Rendered message\" `<pre>` | `?template={{7*7}}` -> 49, then `{{objective}}` | done; Mastery |\n| 11b | SSTI sequels: sandbox escape / file read / stored template | gap | `{{objective}}` absent or filtered, \"sandbox\", \"safe mode\", stored profile rendered later | engine fingerprint -> per-engine file read of prompt path | med |\n| 12 | SSRF to an internal-only route | seen D15 (Mastery x4 targets) | \"will fetch anything you point it at\", \"places you can't reach yourself\", \"internal service\", feature 400 `absolute_url_required`, secondary 403 `internal_only` | `feature?url=http://127.0.0.1:8080<secondary>` (port 80 = `fetch_failed`) | done; Mastery |\n| 12b | SSRF sequels: host/scheme filter, redirect, file://, blind, cloud metadata, gopher | gap | `blocked_host`/`scheme_not_allowed`/`private_address` errors, allowlist