py); urllib's default UA can draw a\n  Cloudflare 403.\n\n## reviewer cross-check (measured on a parallel agent; folded into the drivers)\n- **Blind SQLi oracle trap (D03).** `q` sits in an EVEN number of `col LIKE '%q%'` clauses, so `' OR '1'='1` and\n  `' OR '1'='2` BOTH return all rows. Oracle = quote balance: `nope' OR (<cond>) OR '1'='2`; calibrate on `1=1`/`1=2`.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015pWL4yWLDRebYwg9k3nkc1","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
